WEBVTT

00:07.793 --> 00:08.965
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.034 --> 00:10.275
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.344 --> 00:11.931
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.000 --> 00:14.206
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.275 --> 00:16.758
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:16.827 --> 00:19.034
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.103 --> 00:20.862
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:20.931 --> 00:22.931
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.000 --> 00:24.620
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.689 --> 00:27.068
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.137 --> 00:28.862
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:28.931 --> 00:30.827
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:30.896 --> 00:33.034
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.103 --> 00:35.275
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.344 --> 00:37.310
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.379 --> 00:39.482
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.551 --> 00:40.827
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.896 --> 00:42.689
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.758 --> 00:44.896
[laughing]
[笑]

00:44.965 --> 00:47.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.275 --> 00:49.000
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:49.586 --> 00:53.379
[mellow music]
[柔和的音乐]

00:53.448 --> 00:59.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:59.689 --> 01:01.758
[adventurous music]
[冒险音乐]

01:01.827 --> 01:05.482
- Are you ready
for a bedtime story, Gary?
- 你准备好了吗
睡前故事，加里？

01:07.000 --> 01:10.137
- [meowing, yawns]
- [喵喵叫，打哈欠]

01:10.206 --> 01:11.551
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:11.620 --> 01:13.241
[embellished accent]
Good evening, Gary,
[装饰口音]
晚上好，加里，

01:13.310 --> 01:16.344
and welcome
to Patstarpiece Theatre.
欢迎
前往 Patstarpiece 剧院。

01:19.482 --> 01:21.068
- Hot, hot, hot!
- 热，热，热！

01:22.896 --> 01:26.034
- Hmm, would you like
to hear an exciting story
- 嗯，你愿意吗
听到一个激动人心的故事

01:26.103 --> 01:29.482
about brave Sir Patrick
and the fire-breathing dragon?
关于勇敢的帕特里克爵士
还有喷火龙？

01:29.551 --> 01:31.344
[dragon roaring]
[龙吼]

01:31.413 --> 01:33.310
- [meows]
- [grunts]
- [喵]
- [咕哝]

01:33.379 --> 01:36.206
Or perhaps a thrilling tale
of Explorer Patrick
或者也许是一个惊心动魄的故事
探险家帕特里克

01:36.275 --> 01:38.344
on safari in the jungle?
去丛林探险？

01:38.413 --> 01:39.896
- [roaring]
- [screaming]
- [咆哮]
- [尖叫]

01:39.965 --> 01:42.034
[breathing heavily]
[呼吸粗重]

01:42.103 --> 01:43.482
- [meows]
- [喵]

01:44.827 --> 01:46.482
- Ah!
- 啊！

01:51.068 --> 01:53.275
This is a good one!
"Swamp Mates,"
这是一件好事！
《沼泽伙伴》

01:53.344 --> 01:56.137
a story of two buffoons
in a bog!
两个小丑的故事
在沼泽里！

01:56.206 --> 01:58.586
[laughter]
[笑声]

01:58.655 --> 02:00.068
[cringes]
[畏缩]

02:00.137 --> 02:01.413
Once upon a time,
曾几何时，

02:01.482 --> 02:03.172
there was a saucy superhero
有一个俏皮的超级英雄

02:03.241 --> 02:04.758
with a pugnacious posterior
好斗的后部

02:04.827 --> 02:07.689
and they called him,
"Bubble Bass."
他们称他为：
“泡泡鲈鱼。”

02:07.758 --> 02:09.000
[alarm blaring, screaming]
[警报响起，尖叫]

02:09.068 --> 02:10.827
- [laughs menacingly]
- [威胁性地笑]

02:10.896 --> 02:12.758
- Stop, thief!
- 住手，小偷！

02:14.137 --> 02:15.827
- Hmm.
- 唔。

02:22.620 --> 02:24.896
Hmm.
唔。

02:24.965 --> 02:27.482
- [laughing]
- [笑]

02:30.931 --> 02:34.862
- Excellent job capturing
Man Ray last week, Bubble Bass.
- 出色的工作捕捉
曼雷上周，泡泡巴斯。

02:34.931 --> 02:36.275
- Thank you, Anchor Man.
- 谢谢你，主播。

02:36.344 --> 02:40.793
He was no match
for my mighty hiney.
他不是对手
为了我强大的海妮。

02:40.862 --> 02:43.379
- Hmm.
- 唔。

02:43.448 --> 02:46.689
- [clears throat]
I call this meeting
- [清喉咙]
我称这次会议为

02:46.758 --> 02:51.310
of the Guild of Obsessive Fans,
AKA G.O.O.F's,
狂热粉丝公会的成员，
又名 G.O.O.F，

02:51.379 --> 02:53.413
to order!
Fellow heroes,
来订购！
英雄同胞们，

02:53.482 --> 02:57.620
let us welcome our
newest member, Wonder Whale!
让我们欢迎我们的
新成员，神奇鲸鱼！

02:57.689 --> 03:00.034
- Hmm?
- 唔？

03:00.103 --> 03:01.655
- [clicks tongue]
- [咔嚓舌头]

03:01.724 --> 03:05.034
It would appear
Wonder Whale is late!
就会出现
神奇鲸鱼迟到了！

03:05.103 --> 03:08.172
[beeping]
- Heroes!
[嘟嘟声]
- 英雄们！

03:08.241 --> 03:09.758
- It's the chief!
- 这是酋长！

03:09.827 --> 03:11.000
- Wonder Whale isn't late.
- 神奇鲸鱼没有迟到。

03:11.068 --> 03:12.344
She's been kidnapped
她被绑架了

03:12.413 --> 03:14.172
by the nefarious ne'er-dowell,
邪恶的ne'er-dowell，

03:14.241 --> 03:16.896
HooDoo GooRoo
the VooDoo Villain!
胡都咕噜
巫毒恶棍！

03:16.965 --> 03:19.137
[all gasping]
[全都喘气]

03:19.206 --> 03:21.103
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

03:21.172 --> 03:24.103
- [grunts] Don't worry, Chief.
- [咕哝]别担心，酋长。

03:24.172 --> 03:26.137
We'll rescue Wonder Whale--
我们会拯救神奇鲸鱼——

03:26.206 --> 03:28.965
[banging]
- Bubble Bass!
[砰砰]
- 泡泡鲈鱼！

03:29.034 --> 03:30.620
- Mother?
- 母亲？

03:30.689 --> 03:34.103
- Ah! Your mother!
[whimpers]
- 啊！你的母亲！
[呜咽]

03:34.758 --> 03:36.793
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:36.862 --> 03:39.827
- Why don't you go outside
and make some real friends?
- 你为什么不出去
并结交一些真正的朋友？

03:39.896 --> 03:43.448
- Mother, you know direct
sunlight gives me gas.
- 妈妈，你直接知道
阳光给我气体。

03:43.517 --> 03:47.034
[belches]
Besides, I'm busy looking
[打嗝]
另外，我正忙着寻找

03:47.103 --> 03:49.896
for my Wonder Whale
action figure.
为了我的神奇鲸鱼
动作人物。

03:49.965 --> 03:52.413
- I knew you'd say
something like that,
- 我就知道你会说
类似的东西，

03:52.482 --> 03:56.034
so your mother has scheduled
a play date for you.
所以你妈妈已经安排了
给你一个玩耍的约会。

03:56.103 --> 03:58.793
- I'm not 23 anymore, Mother.
- 我不再是 23 岁了，妈妈。

03:58.862 --> 04:01.758
You'll just have to cancel it.
- It's too late!
你只需要取消它即可。
- 太晚了！

04:01.827 --> 04:03.965
Your new friend
is already here.
你的新朋友
已经在这里了。

04:04.034 --> 04:06.344
Have fun!
玩得开心！

04:06.413 --> 04:08.448
- Huh?
- Hi ya, buddy!
- 啊？
- 嗨，伙计！

04:08.517 --> 04:10.965
Ready for our play date?
准备好我们的玩耍约会了吗？

04:11.034 --> 04:12.896
- I will not associate
- 我不会交往

04:12.965 --> 04:15.310
with such a dimwitted doofus.
和这样一个傻瓜。

04:15.379 --> 04:18.103
- Aw, you're just saying that.
- 哦，你只是这么说。

04:18.172 --> 04:19.724
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:19.793 --> 04:21.310
[grunts, gasps]
[咕哝声，喘气声]

04:21.379 --> 04:23.310
What!
- [laughing]
什么！
- [笑]

04:23.379 --> 04:25.827
- Put those down.
- 把那些放下。

04:25.896 --> 04:27.586
My poor little things.
我可怜的小东西。

04:27.655 --> 04:30.827
Don't worry,
Daddy will protect you.
别担心，
爸爸会保护你的。

04:30.896 --> 04:34.344
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

04:35.034 --> 04:36.689
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:36.758 --> 04:40.586
You've completely chewed up
my limited edition Anchor Man!
你已经彻底咀嚼了
我的限量版主播！

04:40.655 --> 04:42.034
[growls]
[咆哮]

04:42.103 --> 04:45.310
- Sorry, I'm teething.
- 对不起，我正在长牙。

04:47.103 --> 04:52.344
So, what do you wanna
do for our play date?
那么，你想要什么
我们的玩耍约会做什么？

04:52.413 --> 04:56.275
- Hmph, I have no time
for a cretin like you.
——哼，我没时间
对于像你这样的白痴来说。

04:56.344 --> 04:59.034
I must find my
Wonder Whale action figure!
我必须找到我的
神奇鲸鱼可动人偶！

04:59.103 --> 05:02.344
- Oh!
Oh, I'll help you look.
- 哦！
哦，我帮你看看。

05:03.482 --> 05:05.517
- Stop it, you clod.
=> - 停下来，你这个笨蛋。

05:05.586 --> 05:08.620
Do not touch any
of my property.
请勿触摸任何
我的财产。

05:08.689 --> 05:12.413
- That's okay.
We can play with my game!
- 没关系。
我们可以玩我的游戏！

05:12.482 --> 05:17.482
[grunting]
Let's play Swamp!
[咕噜声]
我们来玩沼泽吧！

05:17.551 --> 05:20.379
- [squeals]
Wait, stop!
- [尖叫声]
等等，停下来！

05:20.448 --> 05:23.689
What are you doing?
[shouts]
你在干什么？
[喊叫]

05:23.758 --> 05:25.689
No!
不！

05:25.758 --> 05:27.344
[crying]
[哭泣]

05:27.413 --> 05:29.793
My precious babies.
我的宝贝们。

05:29.862 --> 05:33.379
- No problem,
I'll fix it.
- 没问题，
我会解决它。

05:37.724 --> 05:40.724
My Wonder Whale!
我的神奇鲸鱼！

05:40.793 --> 05:42.068
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

05:42.137 --> 05:44.482
- I got it!
[groans]
- 我得到了它！
[呻吟]

05:44.551 --> 05:47.689
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:47.758 --> 05:49.793
[wailing]
[哀号]

05:51.413 --> 05:53.793
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:53.862 --> 05:55.758
[shouting]
[喊叫]

06:01.689 --> 06:03.172
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

06:03.241 --> 06:06.241
Wonder Whale, where are you?
神奇鲸鱼，你在哪里？

06:06.310 --> 06:10.137
Help!
I...require...
帮助！
我……要求……

06:10.206 --> 06:12.517
assistance.
协助。

06:12.586 --> 06:16.310
- I've got you,
play date partner.
- 我有你，
玩约会伙伴。

06:16.379 --> 06:18.620
Uh, whoa.
呃，哇。

06:18.689 --> 06:23.103
Whoa--
[nervous grumbling]
哇——
[紧张的抱怨]

06:23.172 --> 06:26.000
- [coughing]
- [咳嗽]

06:26.068 --> 06:28.137
Where am I?
我在哪里？

06:28.206 --> 06:29.413
[distant animal shriek]
[远处的动物尖叫声]

06:29.482 --> 06:34.103
By the enchanted spatula
of Suburban Dad.
用魔法抹刀
的郊区爸爸。

06:34.172 --> 06:37.206
We're in a real swamp!
我们正处于真正的沼泽之中！

06:37.275 --> 06:38.655
Ew!
呃！

06:38.724 --> 06:41.689
Why am I wearing
this collar of shame?
为什么我穿着
这耻辱的领子？

06:41.758 --> 06:43.758
- I think it looks good on you.
- 我觉得你穿起来很好看。

06:43.827 --> 06:47.344
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:47.413 --> 06:50.068
Ugh, I despise nature.
唉，我鄙视自然。

06:50.137 --> 06:53.172
- Aw, you just haven't
given it a chance.
- 哦，你只是还没有
给它一个机会。

06:53.241 --> 06:56.241
Smell that swamp air.
闻到沼泽空气的味道。

06:56.310 --> 06:59.275
[inhales]
[吸气]

06:59.344 --> 07:02.793
[gasping]
[喘气]

07:02.862 --> 07:05.896
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

07:08.689 --> 07:12.137
- [gasping]
My tongue!
- [喘气]
我的舌头！

07:12.206 --> 07:15.137
Water, give me water.
水，给我水。

07:19.344 --> 07:20.931
Ew!
呃！

07:21.000 --> 07:24.068
Where did you get
this disgusting liquid?
你从哪里得到的
这种恶心的液体？

07:29.896 --> 07:33.137
Whew.
Slimy and refreshing.
呼。
粘稠而清爽。

07:33.206 --> 07:35.448
- This can't be happening.
- 这不可能发生。

07:35.517 --> 07:38.827
This place is a nightmare!
这个地方就是一场噩梦！

07:38.896 --> 07:43.586
I'll never find
my Wonder Whale action figure.
我永远找不到
我的神奇鲸鱼可动人偶。

07:43.655 --> 07:46.482
- [menacing laughter]
- [威胁性的笑声]

07:46.551 --> 07:48.586
- What is that?
- [shudders]
- 那是什么？
- [颤抖]

07:48.655 --> 07:51.517
- [laughing menacingly]
- [威胁性地笑]

07:51.586 --> 07:54.000
- My Wonder Whale!
- 我的神奇鲸鱼！

07:54.068 --> 07:56.724
That crook stole
my precious possession!
那个骗子偷了
我的宝贵财产！

07:56.793 --> 07:57.931
Get him!
抓住他！

07:58.000 --> 08:00.344
- Are we playing tag?
I love tag!
- 我们在玩捉迷藏吗？
我喜欢标签！

08:00.413 --> 08:02.586
[light mellow music]
【轻柔的音乐】

08:02.655 --> 08:04.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:05.034 --> 08:07.448
- [groans]
- Tag, you're it!
- [呻吟]
- 标签，就是你了！

08:07.517 --> 08:10.586
[laughing]
- [menacing laughter]
[笑]
- [威胁性的笑声]

08:11.586 --> 08:14.586
- [gasps]
After him!
- [喘气]
追他！

08:14.655 --> 08:16.413
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

08:16.482 --> 08:18.586
- [laughing]
- [笑]

08:18.655 --> 08:21.000
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

08:22.137 --> 08:25.172
Whoa-oh-oh! [grunts]
- Where'd he go?
哇哦哦！ [咕哝]
- 他去哪儿了？

08:25.241 --> 08:29.517
- Perhaps he's in that
dilapidated dwelling.
- 也许他就在其中
破旧的住宅。

08:29.586 --> 08:30.724
- I doubt it.
- 我对此表示怀疑。

08:30.793 --> 08:33.517
Maybe he's in that shack?
也许他就在那个小屋里？

08:33.586 --> 08:35.862
[banjo music]
[班卓琴音乐]

08:35.931 --> 08:37.586
[machine hisses]
[机器嘶嘶声]

08:37.655 --> 08:41.482
- Huh.
It's just some uncouth natives.
- 嗯。
这只是一些粗鲁的当地人。

08:41.551 --> 08:43.241
- Hello!
- 你好！

08:43.310 --> 08:44.827
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

08:44.896 --> 08:47.413
- I caught these two
a peepin' through the window.
- 我抓住了这两个人
透过窗户偷看。

08:47.482 --> 08:49.586
- They're thieves!
Trying to steal
- 他们是小偷！
试图偷窃

08:49.655 --> 08:52.275
our illegal hot sauce.
我们的非法辣酱。

08:52.344 --> 08:53.827
- Illegal?
- 非法的？

08:53.896 --> 08:56.551
- Our swamp sauce is so spicy
- 我们的沼泽酱太辣了

08:56.620 --> 08:59.413
it can blow
your head clean off.
它可以吹
你的头干净了。

08:59.482 --> 09:01.724
- I assure you
we are not interested
- 我向你保证
我们不感兴趣

09:01.793 --> 09:03.793
in your disgusting hot sauce.
在你恶心的辣酱里。

09:03.862 --> 09:05.448
- Then what's he doing?
- 那他在做什么？

09:05.517 --> 09:07.517
- [gulping]
- [吞咽]

09:11.413 --> 09:14.620
[muffled shouting]
[低声喊叫]

09:14.689 --> 09:18.000
[whistle blaring]
[汽笛声]

09:19.586 --> 09:20.724
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

09:20.793 --> 09:24.068
- Huh.
You call that spicy?
- 嗯。
你管这叫辣？

09:24.137 --> 09:26.068
[belches]
[打嗝]

09:28.068 --> 09:30.827
- Back off,
you backwater bumpkins!
- 退后，
你们这些穷乡僻壤！

09:30.896 --> 09:32.206
[dramatic bluegrass music]
[戏剧性的蓝草音乐]

09:32.275 --> 09:34.379
Run!
- [shrieks]
跑步！
- [尖叫]

09:34.448 --> 09:36.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:36.655 --> 09:38.551
- After 'em, boys!
- 追随他们，孩子们！

09:38.620 --> 09:40.310
[both growling]
[双方咆哮]

09:40.379 --> 09:43.551
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

09:45.379 --> 09:47.172
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

09:47.241 --> 09:48.689
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

09:48.758 --> 09:51.103
- You ain't a-gettin'
away that easy!
- 你没搞好
走开就这么容易！

09:51.172 --> 09:52.206
- Yee-ha.
- 是啊哈。

09:52.275 --> 09:54.586
- [panting, yelps]
- [气喘吁吁，尖叫]

10:01.275 --> 10:05.482
- Ha, too slow,
you cold-blooded clowns.
- 哈，太慢了，
你们这些冷血的小丑。

10:05.551 --> 10:08.068
[muttering mockingly]
[嘲讽地嘀咕]

10:11.206 --> 10:12.206
Yipe!
哎呀！

10:12.275 --> 10:14.482
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

10:14.551 --> 10:17.310
Those Crocs are catching up
with us!
那些 Crocs 正在迎头赶上
和我们一起！

10:17.379 --> 10:19.931
- [groans]
That hot sauce
- [呻吟]
那个辣酱

10:20.000 --> 10:23.241
has already caught up with me.
已经追上了我。

10:23.310 --> 10:25.241
[belches]
[打嗝]

10:27.344 --> 10:30.000
- [gasps]
That's it!
- [喘气]
就是这样！

10:35.551 --> 10:37.517
- [belching]
- [打嗝]

10:37.586 --> 10:38.758
- What?
- 什么？

10:38.827 --> 10:42.241
[rudder slowing, stops]
[舵减慢，停止]

10:45.586 --> 10:49.172
- [sighs]
So play date partner,
- [叹气]
所以玩约会伙伴，

10:49.241 --> 10:52.103
what are we supposed
to do now. Hmm?
我们应该做什么
现在要做。唔？

10:52.172 --> 10:54.103
- [gurgling]
- [咯咯声]

10:54.172 --> 10:56.931
[laughing]
[笑]

10:57.758 --> 11:01.068
- [menacing laughter]
- [威胁性的笑声]

11:01.137 --> 11:02.896
[sinister music]
[险恶的音乐]

11:02.965 --> 11:06.310
- Give me back my Wonder Whale!
- 把我的神奇鲸鱼还给我！

11:07.206 --> 11:08.172
- Huh?
- 啊？

11:09.000 --> 11:11.620
- Huh? Hey, wait for me, buddy!
- 啊？嘿，等我一下，伙计！

11:11.689 --> 11:13.586
- [laughing]
- Come back here.
- [笑]
- 回到这里。

11:13.655 --> 11:16.103
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

11:17.586 --> 11:20.793
You'll swing for this,
you ruffian!
你会为此而摇摆，
你这个痞子！

11:20.862 --> 11:24.172
- I am afraid you are
the ones who will swing.
- 恐怕你是
那些会摇摆的人。

11:24.241 --> 11:26.758
[laughing]
[笑]

11:26.827 --> 11:29.931
You ignoramuses fell
right into my trap!
无知的你们堕落了
正好落入我的陷阱！

11:30.000 --> 11:32.275
- Technically, I'm a doofus.
- 从技术上来说，我是个傻瓜。

11:34.344 --> 11:37.655
- HooDoo Guru
the Voodoo Villain!
- HooDoo 大师
巫毒恶棍！

11:37.724 --> 11:39.413
He's real!
他是真实的！

11:39.482 --> 11:40.827
- That's right, Bubble Bass,
- 没错，泡泡巴斯，

11:40.896 --> 11:44.275
and your precious
Wonder Whale is all mine!
和你珍贵的
神奇鲸鱼都是我的了！

11:44.344 --> 11:47.344
- I dread to think
what horrific ritual
- 我不敢想
什么可怕的仪式

11:47.413 --> 11:49.241
you will use it for.
你将用它来。

11:49.310 --> 11:51.931
- Huh? Ritual, shmitual!
- 啊？仪式，什米特！

11:52.862 --> 11:56.103
I just needed it
to complete my collection!
我只是需要它
来完成我的收藏！

11:56.172 --> 11:59.586
- Stealing from
a fellow collector?
- 偷窃
一位收藏家？

11:59.655 --> 12:01.724
That's despicable!
真是卑鄙啊！

12:01.793 --> 12:04.413
I will thrash you, sir!
我要打你，先生！

12:04.482 --> 12:07.172
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

12:10.896 --> 12:13.793
Can't break out.
[bell dings]
无法突破。
[铃声]

12:13.862 --> 12:15.827
- You're probably weak
from hunger.
- 你可能很弱
来自饥饿。

12:15.896 --> 12:19.206
Here, try some
of this spaghetti.
在这里，尝试一些
这个意大利面。

12:19.275 --> 12:21.448
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

12:21.517 --> 12:25.655
Mmm!
Glorious caloric intake!
嗯！
光荣的热量摄入！

12:25.724 --> 12:27.724
Wherever did you find it?
你在哪里找到的？

12:27.793 --> 12:30.482
- We're sitting on it!
- 我们正坐在上面！

12:30.551 --> 12:32.241
[slurping]
[发出声音]

12:32.310 --> 12:34.586
[both shriek, grunt]
[两人都尖叫、咕哝]

12:34.655 --> 12:37.206
- Ouch.
- [gasps]
- 哎哟。
- [喘气]

12:37.275 --> 12:40.379
Ha ha!
Evil never triumphs
哈哈！
Evil never triumphs

12:40.448 --> 12:43.724
against a truly obsessive fan!
对抗真正的狂热粉丝！

12:43.793 --> 12:46.551
- Yeah!
Evil never triumphs
- 是的！
邪恶永远不会胜利

12:46.620 --> 12:48.793
over a oscillating fan!
在振荡风扇上！

12:48.862 --> 12:50.275
- [groans]
Hm?
- [呻吟]
嗯？

12:50.344 --> 12:52.344
Not so fast, Bubble Bass.
别那么快，泡泡巴斯。

12:52.413 --> 12:55.413
I've got one more trick
up my sleeve.
我还有一招
up my sleeve.

12:55.482 --> 12:58.103
Or should I say,
up my glove!
或者我应该说，
举起我的手套！

12:58.172 --> 13:01.586
[screaming]
[laughs menacingly]
[尖叫]
[威胁性地笑]

13:01.655 --> 13:04.689
- A Patrick Star action figure?
- 帕特里克明星动作玩偶？

13:04.758 --> 13:06.724
Ha!
No collector would
哈!
没有收藏家会

13:06.793 --> 13:08.448
touch such trash.
碰这样的垃圾。

13:08.517 --> 13:10.413
- Plus, it's a choking hazard.
- 另外，还有窒息的危险。

13:10.482 --> 13:12.172
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

13:13.862 --> 13:15.965
- What's going on?
- 这是怎么回事？

13:16.034 --> 13:18.551
- That fiend, HooDoo,
is using his magic
- 那个恶魔，HooDoo，
正在使用他的魔法

13:18.620 --> 13:20.344
Voodoo doll powers.
巫毒娃娃的力量。

13:20.413 --> 13:22.275
- [laughing]
- [笑]

13:22.344 --> 13:23.551
[grunts]
[咕哝]

13:23.620 --> 13:26.724
- [choking]
- Sorry.
- [窒息]
- 抱歉。

13:26.793 --> 13:29.448
- I'll take that.
[laughs]
- 我会接受的。
[笑]

13:33.413 --> 13:35.344
[laughing]
[笑]

13:35.413 --> 13:37.000
[both shouting]
[两人大喊]

13:37.068 --> 13:39.655
- Stop!
I'm allergic
- 停止！
我过敏

13:39.724 --> 13:42.379
to centrifugal force!
到离心力！

13:42.448 --> 13:44.931
- [laughing]
- [笑]

13:46.103 --> 13:47.931
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

13:52.103 --> 13:55.862
- Ha! I'll return this
to its rightful owner.
- 哈！我会归还这个
归其合法所有者。

13:55.931 --> 13:58.655
Me.
- Well done, pal.
我。
- 干得好，朋友。

13:58.724 --> 14:00.413
- Eww.
- 呃。

14:00.482 --> 14:02.689
both:
Huh?
两者：
啊？

14:02.758 --> 14:04.517
- Hey, Luther, Cletus,
- 嘿，路德，克莱特斯，

14:04.586 --> 14:07.275
I found them fellers
what blowed up our still!
我发现他们是家伙
是什么炸毁了我们的蒸馏器！

14:07.344 --> 14:09.413
- Oh, hi!
- 哦，嗨！

14:09.482 --> 14:11.931
- [gargled] Run.
- [漱口]跑。

14:12.000 --> 14:13.620
[dramatic bluegrass music]
[戏剧性的蓝草音乐]

14:13.689 --> 14:15.862
- [whimpering]
[all growling]
- [呜咽]
[全都咆哮]

14:15.931 --> 14:19.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:20.034 --> 14:23.793
- No, our only escape!
- 不，我们唯一的逃脱！

14:23.862 --> 14:27.931
If only I had something
large and buoyant.
如果我有什么就好了
大而有浮力。

14:28.000 --> 14:31.827
- I don't know what
that means, but--
- 我不知道什么
这意味着，但是——

14:31.896 --> 14:33.758
Hop on, friend!
加油，朋友！

14:33.827 --> 14:35.206
- Friend?
- 朋友？

14:35.275 --> 14:38.241
- Sure, you're my play date,
right, buddy?
- 当然，你是我的约会对象
对吧，伙计？

14:38.310 --> 14:41.241
- [stammering]
Buddy?
- [结巴]
伙计？

14:41.310 --> 14:44.413
[dramatic classical music]
[戏剧古典音乐]

14:44.482 --> 14:46.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:46.620 --> 14:48.965
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

14:49.827 --> 14:53.275
- It's over, Bubble Bass!
Give up!
- 结束了，泡泡巴斯！
放弃！

14:53.344 --> 14:55.551
- You will never win, Voodoo,
- 你永远不会赢，巫毒，

14:55.620 --> 15:00.310
because we have the power
of reluctant friendship!
因为我们有力量
不情愿的友谊！

15:00.379 --> 15:03.689
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

15:03.758 --> 15:06.068
- Yeah, that's right.
- 是的，没错。

15:06.137 --> 15:09.862
Run away from
our righteous acquaintance!
逃离
我们的正义相识！

15:09.931 --> 15:13.379
- Uh, they might
be running from that.
- 呃，他们可能
逃离那个。

15:15.965 --> 15:18.275
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

15:24.413 --> 15:25.758
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

15:25.827 --> 15:31.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:34.793 --> 15:37.000
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

15:40.758 --> 15:42.379
- What happened?
- 发生了什么？

15:42.448 --> 15:46.172
- Oh, you were dead
for like ten minutes.
- 哦，你死了
大约十分钟。

15:46.241 --> 15:50.931
- Oh, it was all
just a hallucination?
- 哦，就这样了
只是幻觉？

15:51.000 --> 15:53.551
Then my Wonder Whale
action figure
然后是我的神奇鲸鱼
动作人物

15:53.620 --> 15:55.793
is still missing.
仍然失踪。

15:55.862 --> 15:57.931
- Well, you may have
lost your toy,
- 嗯，你可能有
你的玩具丢了，

15:58.000 --> 16:00.551
but you've gained
an indoor pool!
但你已经获得了
一个室内游泳池！

16:00.620 --> 16:02.448
Congratulations!
恭喜！

16:02.517 --> 16:07.551
- [gasps]
My precious Wonder Whale!
- [喘气]
我珍贵的神奇鲸鱼！

16:07.620 --> 16:09.034
- Bubble Bass!
- 泡泡鲈鱼！

16:09.103 --> 16:13.068
What did you do
to my basement?
你做了什么
到我的地下室？

16:13.137 --> 16:17.103
- Perhaps the swamp
wasn't so bad after all.
- 也许是沼泽
毕竟没那么糟糕。

16:17.172 --> 16:19.103
[downtrodden music]
[压抑的音乐]

16:19.172 --> 16:21.517
- Best play date ever!
- 有史以来最好的玩耍日期！

16:25.827 --> 16:28.172
- [laughs]
Whoo-hoo!
- [笑]
呼呼！

16:28.241 --> 16:30.931
This completes my collection.
[laughing]
这完成了我的收藏。
[笑]

16:31.000 --> 16:46.827
- [mechanical laughter]
- [机械笑声]

16:46.896 --> 16:48.448
- Ta-da!
- 哒哒！

16:48.517 --> 16:50.689
I did it,
I did it, I did it!
我做到了，
我做到了，我做到了！

16:50.758 --> 16:53.448
I--whoa--
[crashing]
我——哇——
[崩溃]

16:58.517 --> 17:01.896
- [meows]
- I learned a magic trick!
- [喵]
- 我学会了一个魔术！

17:01.965 --> 17:04.413
Sorry, Gary,
but I've been trying to learn
对不起，加里，
但我一直在努力学习

17:04.482 --> 17:06.206
this trick since
I was a SpongeBoy!
这个伎俩自从
我是海绵宝宝！

17:06.275 --> 17:07.862
[gasps]
- [meows]
[喘气]
- [喵]

17:07.931 --> 17:09.793
- I gotta show Patrick!
- 我得让帕特里克看看！

17:09.862 --> 17:11.965
[laughs]
[笑]

17:13.758 --> 17:17.482
Patrick, come out,
I gotta show you something!
帕特里克，出来吧，
我得给你看点东西！

17:17.551 --> 17:19.758
Patrick!
帕特里克！

17:19.827 --> 17:22.620
He's not home.
他不在家。

17:24.758 --> 17:28.137
Oh!
Squidward!
哦！
章鱼哥！

17:28.206 --> 17:30.758
- [gasps]
- Squidward!
- [喘气]
- 章鱼哥！

17:30.827 --> 17:34.551
Squidward, Squidward,
Squidward, Squidward...
章鱼哥，章鱼哥，
章鱼哥，章鱼哥……

17:34.620 --> 17:37.172
- If he thinks I'm out,
he'll go away.
- 如果他认为我出局了
他会走开。

17:37.241 --> 17:41.137
- Squidward, Squidward!
- [grunting]
- 章鱼哥，章鱼哥！
- [咕哝]

17:42.689 --> 17:45.103
- Squidward!
- 章鱼哥！

17:47.793 --> 17:49.241
I'm so glad you're home.
我很高兴你回家了。

17:49.310 --> 17:50.896
Got a magic trick to show ya.
我有一个魔术表演给你看。

17:50.965 --> 17:53.068
- I...hate magic.
- 我...讨厌魔法。

17:53.137 --> 17:56.275
- How could anyone hate magic?
It's...
- 怎么会有人讨厌魔法呢？
它是...

17:56.344 --> 17:58.068
magical.
神奇。

17:58.137 --> 18:00.724
- [sighs]
Okay.
- [叹气]
好的。

18:00.793 --> 18:02.689
Show me the trick.
给我看看技巧。

18:02.758 --> 18:04.379
- [laughs]
- [笑]

18:04.448 --> 18:06.034
- [groans]
- Pick a card!
- [呻吟]
- 选择一张卡！

18:06.103 --> 18:07.310
Oh.
哦。

18:07.379 --> 18:09.000
[grunts]
[咕哝]

18:10.482 --> 18:12.344
[gulps]
[吞咽]

18:13.551 --> 18:15.827
[humming]
- Watch closely, Squidward.
[嗡嗡声]
- 仔细观察，章鱼哥。

18:15.896 --> 18:18.172
The hand is quicker
than the eye!
手比较快
比眼睛！

18:22.586 --> 18:24.241
- Can't watch, no eyes.
Sorry.
- 无法观看，没有眼睛。
对不起。

18:24.310 --> 18:28.034
- Oh, I wanna show
my trick to somebody.
- 哦，我想展示
我对某人的伎俩。

18:28.103 --> 18:29.620
[crying]
[哭泣]

18:29.689 --> 18:31.379
- [chuckles, yelps]
- [轻笑，尖叫]

18:31.448 --> 18:32.827
Ow.
噢。

18:32.896 --> 18:36.862
- You're the best driving
student I've ever had, Rodger.
- 你是最棒的驾驶者
我曾经有过一个学生，罗杰。

18:36.931 --> 18:39.413
Kudos!
- [laughs]
荣誉！
- [笑]

18:39.482 --> 18:41.172
- Mrs. Puff!
- 泡芙夫人！

18:41.241 --> 18:44.310
Mrs. Puff?
Mrs. Puff!
泡芙夫人？
泡芙太太！

18:44.379 --> 18:46.862
- Rodger, we have to move now.
- 罗杰，我们现在必须走了。

18:46.931 --> 18:48.517
Punch it!
冲吧！

18:52.241 --> 18:54.517
[chuckles]
I think we lost him.
[笑声]
我想我们失去了他。

18:54.586 --> 18:56.724
- Mrs. Puff,
you gotta see my magic trick!
- 普芙女士，
你一定要看看我的魔术！

18:56.793 --> 18:59.482
[both shouting]
[两人大喊]

19:02.827 --> 19:04.724
Pick a card, any card!
选择一张卡，任何卡！

19:04.793 --> 19:06.172
- Hold on, SpongeBob.
- 坚持住，海绵宝宝。

19:06.241 --> 19:09.034
I have a trick
to show you, first.
我有一个绝招
首先向您展示。

19:09.103 --> 19:10.689
- [shouts]
- [喊叫]

19:10.758 --> 19:12.310
- Sorry, Rodger.
- 对不起，罗杰。

19:12.379 --> 19:14.655
We'll pick this up next week.
我们将在下周再讨论这个问题。

19:14.724 --> 19:17.206
- Wait, Mrs. Puff,
you didn't see my trick.
- 等等，帕夫夫人，
你没有看到我的伎俩。

19:17.275 --> 19:20.896
- Okay, show me
the trick already.
- 好的，给我看看
已经是窍门了。

19:20.965 --> 19:22.172
- Pick a card, any--
- 选一张牌，任意——

19:22.241 --> 19:23.896
[screams]
- [sighs]
[尖叫声]
- [叹气]

19:23.965 --> 19:26.551
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

19:29.482 --> 19:32.206
Sandy!
沙！

19:33.344 --> 19:35.172
Sandy, I gotta show you this!
桑迪，我得给你看这个！

19:35.241 --> 19:38.034
Pick a card, any card!
[shouting]
选择一张卡，任何卡！
[喊叫]

19:38.103 --> 19:39.655
Sandy?
沙？

19:40.931 --> 19:42.275
Where's your head?
你的头在哪儿？

19:42.344 --> 19:44.827
- Oh, sorry, SpongeBob,
didn't mean to spook ya.
- 哦，对不起，海绵宝宝，
无意吓唬你。

19:44.896 --> 19:46.551
My head's in another dimension
我的头在另一个维度

19:46.620 --> 19:48.379
observing.
观察。

19:49.793 --> 19:51.586
Hmm.
唔。

19:54.586 --> 19:56.827
- Oh, okay.
I'll come back later
- 哦好的。
我以后会回来的

19:56.896 --> 19:58.379
when you have a head.
当你有头的时候。

19:58.448 --> 20:00.000
- It should
be back by Thursday.
- 应该
周四之前回来。

20:00.068 --> 20:02.103
Friday at the latest.
最迟星期五。

20:02.172 --> 20:04.793
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

20:06.034 --> 20:07.379
- Who is it?
- 是谁？

20:07.448 --> 20:10.034
- Pick a card, any card!
- [yelps]
- 选择一张卡，任何卡！
- [尖叫声]

20:10.103 --> 20:12.344
[accordion music plays]
[手风琴音乐演奏]

20:12.413 --> 20:14.000
Magic, eh, boy-o?
魔法，呃，男孩？

20:14.068 --> 20:16.517
Is this by any chance
a trick where you produce
这是偶然吗
你产生的一个技巧

20:16.586 --> 20:19.034
money coins from behind
people's ears?
钱币从后面
人们的耳朵？

20:19.103 --> 20:20.827
Wink, wink, hmm?
眨眼，眨眼，嗯？

20:20.896 --> 20:21.965
- No.
- 不。

20:22.034 --> 20:24.517
- Then what's the point?
Hm!
- 那还有什么意义呢？
嗯！

20:24.586 --> 20:26.827
- Ah!
- 啊！

20:28.862 --> 20:30.310
Hi, Fred.
嗨，弗雷德。

20:30.379 --> 20:32.206
I got a magic trick
that's gonna dazzle you.
我有一个魔术
那会让你眼花缭乱。

20:32.275 --> 20:34.551
- Ooh, are you gonna saw
my leg in half,
- 哦，你会看到吗
我的腿分成两半

20:34.620 --> 20:37.620
or make it disappear,
or pull a rabbit out of it?
或者让它消失，
或者从里面拉出一只兔子？

20:37.689 --> 20:40.275
- Uh, no, this isn't going
to involve your leg.
- 呃，不，这不会发生
让你的腿参与进来。

20:40.344 --> 20:43.689
- Oh, gotta go, SpongeBob.
I'm washing my thighs tonight.
- 哦，得走了，海绵宝宝。
今晚我要洗大腿。

20:44.517 --> 20:45.551
My leg!
我的腿！

20:45.620 --> 20:49.206
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

20:50.344 --> 20:53.482
Why won't anyone
watch my trick?
为什么没有人
看我的把戏吗？

20:53.551 --> 20:57.172
[echoing]
Trick, trick, trick.
[回声]
诡计，诡计，诡计。

21:03.482 --> 21:05.793
Hmm...
唔...

21:05.862 --> 21:07.379
Ooh.
哦。

21:07.448 --> 21:09.827
Hey, that gives me an idea!
嘿，这给了我一个主意！

21:11.068 --> 21:12.551
There.
那里。

21:12.620 --> 21:16.206
Good evening, folks.
I am the great Sponge-dini.
晚上好，各位。
我是伟大的海绵迪尼。

21:16.275 --> 21:17.517
Now watch closely.
现在仔细观察。

21:17.586 --> 21:20.000
The hand is quicker
than the eye.
手比较快
比眼睛。

21:20.068 --> 21:22.965
Uh-huh, ha, pick a card,
any card.
呵呵，选一张卡吧
任何卡。

21:23.034 --> 21:25.551
[inhales]
[吸气]

21:25.620 --> 21:28.724
[dazzling orchestra music]
[令人眼花缭乱的管弦乐]

21:28.793 --> 21:35.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:58.137 --> 21:59.724
Hm?
嗯？

22:07.827 --> 22:10.172
Ta-da!
哒哒！

22:12.206 --> 22:14.758
Aw, I still wish
Patrick was here to see it.
唉，我还是希望
帕特里克在这里看到了这一点。

22:14.827 --> 22:16.965
- I saw it, SpongeBob!
- 我看到了，海绵宝宝！

22:17.034 --> 22:20.068
It was astonish-able!
真是令人惊讶！

22:20.137 --> 22:22.965
[shouts]
[喊叫]

22:23.965 --> 22:26.793
- Oh, Patrick,
you showed up just in time.
- 哦，帕特里克，
你出现得真及时。

22:26.862 --> 22:28.517
What was your favorite part?
你最喜欢的部分是什么？

22:28.586 --> 22:29.931
- Uh...
- 呃...

22:30.000 --> 22:31.931
my favorite part was...
我最喜欢的部分是...

22:32.000 --> 22:34.000
Ta-da!
哒哒！

22:34.068 --> 22:36.241
I missed everything
before that.
我错过了一切
在那之前。

22:36.310 --> 22:38.896
- Oh, then you
haven't seen anything yet!
- 哦，那你
还没有看到任何东西！

22:38.965 --> 22:41.344
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

22:41.413 --> 22:43.862
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

22:43.931 --> 22:50.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪